	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Fuerunt hic pridie comitia, in quibus ille de Quadriis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>causam suam proposuit, cum iam ante hic in arce episcopi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>substitisset totum octiduum, et mirum est, quam omnes ambierit <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et singulos quidem legatos separatim.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed vide tu mirabilem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in rebus humanis providentiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Illius su plicatio, quam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>de scripto in comitiis proposuit, ante in meas manus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mirabili casu venit, si casus is est appellandus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et non consilium potius divinum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">Als den vordrigen tag <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>unsere herren ire botten, bed burgermeister, zuͦ den überigen <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>rhaatsbotten, so uff den bytag kommen soltend, verordnet, hand <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sy inen in entpfelch geben, sich mit gewalt wider desse <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>von Quadriis fürnemmen ze legen.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Daaruff der von Quadriis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>rhaat funden das er in syner supplicatz keiner sonderen schuͦl <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>oder münchsordens gedenckt, sonder allein anzeigt, wie er, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>von gottes gnaaden mitt guͦtt rychlich begaabet, keine kindt habe; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sygind aber vyl jüngling in synem vatterland, die uß mangel der <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>schuͦlmeisteren größlich versumpt werdind; wölle er, gott vorab <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>zuͦ eeren und synem vatterland zuͦ guͦtem, einen schuͦlmeister <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>in synen kosten erhalten.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Daamit das aber mer krafft und <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ansechen haben möge, bitte er ir grosmächtickheit <foreign xml:lang="la">(tali enim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>titulo dignatur),</foreign> sy wöllind ir erkantnuß hye harüber geben etc., <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>darmit werdind sy gott vorab, demnoch ouch keiserlicher majestät <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>großlich dienen etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">En, quam astute vulpecula!</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Er vermeint, er <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>wölle es also in einem schnap erwüschen,</foreign> et certe haec res <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>visa fuisset non iniusta.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Legati ergo omnes informandi fuerunt <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>de molitionibus huius hominis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">In summa res eo deducta est <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>dei gratia, ut nostris incipiat esse suspecta, et in tanto <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>consessu nemo fuit, qui illius a Quadriis causam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>defendendam susceperit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Reiecta tamen haec causa est ad <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>futura generalia et magna comitia, <foreign xml:lang="de">uff ein pundtstag.</foreign></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Ita ille nunc quidem infecta re discessit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ludimagister, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ut ex legato intelligimus, cuius et operam ille, sed frustra ambiit, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><placeName ref="l875">Hispanus</placeName> est etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Rumor ille de dracone illo non omnino vanus fuit, sed <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quod fit, dum quisque aliquid affingit, per mendacia quoque crevit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName>Augustinus a Salicibus</persName>, vir fide dignus, nobis retulit praesentibus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>utroque consule et aliis bonis viris eum conspectum esse, sed <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>nonnisi a duobus et quidem separatim, quorum tamen <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>descriptio non discrepet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Non tamen adeo mirum illis hoc accidisse, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>quod ante triginta annos indigena quidam, qui etiamnunc <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>superstes sit, ingentis magnitudinis vermem in rupe <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>quadam praerupta apricantem ictu bombardae confecerit, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>cuius tabes tam pestilens fuerit, ut virus ventum <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>adversum sequutum homini visum eripuerit et caetera <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ita inflarit, ut vita eius iam plane esset desperata; <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>eum tamen, cum vix semimortua membra traheret domum <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>tandem devenisse locumque suis demonstrasse et post aliquot <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>dies illum vermem interfectum esse repertum etc.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Quae <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> afferantur, habes ex literis hisce Italice scriptis, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>quas tu dabis legendas d. d. <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyri</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Summa earum haec <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>est: nobiles Romanos impedire creationem novi pontificis <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>et cupere in posterum aliquid de pontificis authoritate deminutum, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>et haec verisimilia sunt.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Nam <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName>, ut audio, in 50 vicos <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>aut amplius distributa est; singulis autem vicis singuli attributi <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>sunt tribuni (tribunum illi capirionem appellant).</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Hi post hominum <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>memoriam non leguntur ita in unum consensisse omnes ac <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>nuper in odium pontificis etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/><persName ref="p6130">Pontisellae</persName> d. <persName ref="p1884">Leodovici Lavateri</persName>, generi tui, literae sunt redditae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Erit res ei unice curae; nunc scribere propter vindemias <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>non potest, sed scribet proxime.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>D. d. <lb xml:id="p2z29"/><persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> libenter mitterem, quae a me expectat; sed non habeo, <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>cui commode dem.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Cum primum nactus fuero idoneum aliquem <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>hominem, scribam et simul mittam mittenda, licet de seno <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>ibicis nondum habeo, quod pro certo polliceri possim.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Salvum te cupiunt nostri omnes d. consul, d. <persName>Philippus</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Salutem ex nobis dicito tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 18. septembris <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>anno 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z4"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>tui observantissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo viro eruditione <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>et pietate excellenti d. <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p4z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>domino et patrono <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>suo plurimum <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
